<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Information on data handling and inquiries for the Trade90 website." canonical="/privacy/">
<main class="wrap"><article class="article"><header class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">Trade90</span><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Updated 19 October 2026</p></header>
<h2>Browsing the website</h2><p>You can view Trade90's rate comparisons and educational guides without signing in. Web hosting and security providers may process technical request information, such as IP addresses, timestamps, browser details and request logs, to deliver and protect the website.</p>
<h2>Google Analytics</h2><p>With your permission, we use Google Analytics to measure page views and website usage. Analytics loads after you accept; declining keeps Google Analytics from loading on subsequent pages. Your choice is saved in this browser. Use Analytics preferences in the footer to change it. Advertising personalization and Google signals are disabled.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>If you email us, we may retain the email and the content you provide to respond to your inquiry or correction request. Do not include broker passwords or sensitive financial credentials.</p>
<h2>Previous Trade90 accounts</h2><p>Trade90 previously provided sign-in and cloud workspace features. The new public interface does not provide account management. If you previously created an account and want to inquire about or request removal of legacy account data, contact us using the address below. Removing the interface does not itself erase stored legacy records.</p>
<h2>Other services</h2><p>Hosting, performance measurement and advertising arrangements may change. Where optional analytics, advertising or similar technologies are used, applicable provider policies and consent requirements should be reviewed separately. This page does not mean that previous browser cookies or offline caches have been removed from every device.</p>
<h2>Data requests</h2><p>For privacy inquiries, write to <a href="mailto:admin@tradeninety.com">admin@tradeninety.com</a>.</p></article></main>
</Layout>
